@startuml
title Preload API / IPC / 本地服务通信图

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Renderer 页面与组件" as Renderer

package "Preload API" {
  [window.api.kb]
  [window.api.codeRepo]
  [window.api.agent]
  [window.api.intel]
  [window.api.music]
  [window.api.voice]
  [window.api.system]
}

package "IPC Channels" {
  [kb:*]
  [codeRepo:*]
  [agent:*]
  [intel:*]
  [music:*]
  [voice:*]
  [system:*]
}

package "Electron 主进程 Handlers" {
  [KbIpcHandler]
  [CodeRepoIpcHandler]
  [AgentIpcHandler]
  [IntelIpcHandler]
  [MusicIpcHandler]
  [VoiceIpcHandler]
  [SystemIpcHandler]
}

package "本地能力 Adapters" {
  [Knowledge Adapter]
  [Git Adapter]
  [File Adapter]
  [Process Adapter]
  [LLM Provider Adapter]
  [local-intel Service Adapter]
  [Music Adapter]
  [Voice Adapter]
  [App DB Adapter]
}

Renderer --> [window.api.kb]
Renderer --> [window.api.codeRepo]
Renderer --> [window.api.agent]
Renderer --> [window.api.intel]
Renderer --> [window.api.music]
Renderer --> [window.api.voice]
Renderer --> [window.api.system]

[window.api.kb] --> [kb:*]
[window.api.codeRepo] --> [codeRepo:*]
[window.api.agent] --> [agent:*]
[window.api.intel] --> [intel:*]
[window.api.music] --> [music:*]
[window.api.voice] --> [voice:*]
[window.api.system] --> [system:*]

[kb:*] --> [KbIpcHandler]
[codeRepo:*] --> [CodeRepoIpcHandler]
[agent:*] --> [AgentIpcHandler]
[intel:*] --> [IntelIpcHandler]
[music:*] --> [MusicIpcHandler]
[voice:*] --> [VoiceIpcHandler]
[system:*] --> [SystemIpcHandler]

[KbIpcHandler] --> [Knowledge Adapter]
[KbIpcHandler] --> [LLM Provider Adapter]
[KbIpcHandler] --> [App DB Adapter]

[CodeRepoIpcHandler] --> [Git Adapter]
[CodeRepoIpcHandler] --> [File Adapter]
[CodeRepoIpcHandler] --> [Process Adapter]
[CodeRepoIpcHandler] --> [LLM Provider Adapter]

[AgentIpcHandler] --> [LLM Provider Adapter]
[AgentIpcHandler] --> [Knowledge Adapter]
[AgentIpcHandler] --> [Git Adapter]
[AgentIpcHandler] --> [local-intel Service Adapter]
[AgentIpcHandler] --> [App DB Adapter]

[IntelIpcHandler] --> [local-intel Service Adapter]
[IntelIpcHandler] --> [Process Adapter]

[MusicIpcHandler] --> [Music Adapter]
[MusicIpcHandler] --> [App DB Adapter]

[VoiceIpcHandler] --> [Voice Adapter]
[VoiceIpcHandler] --> [LLM Provider Adapter]

[SystemIpcHandler] --> [File Adapter]
[SystemIpcHandler] --> [Process Adapter]

note right of Renderer
Renderer 只通过 window.api.* 调用能力。
不直接访问 Node、文件系统、Git、数据库或 API Key。
end note

@enduml
